{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1258329,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Elżbieta Wąsik","original_name":"Elżbieta Wąsik","popularity":0.6858,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":1447108,"title":"Niesamowite przygody skarpetek","original_title":"Niesamowite przygody skarpetek","overview":"Have you ever wondered what happens to all those missing socks? We've all had that experience - we throw a pair of socks into a drawer, closet or laundry basket and then take them out... just one sock! Where do they disappear to? Perhaps they secretly dream of a more fascinating life than serving our feet? Perhaps they would like to become movie stars or politicians? Or maybe, dropping into a corner of our room, they travel back in time to prehistory? Wherever they end up, their adventures are sure to be filled with fun!","poster_path":"/7fAe9ZgTQeMdEqMJlHu0RSgLF4v.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[16,14,10751,12],"popularity":0.9679,"release_date":"2025-04-25","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":1553227,"title":"Vicious Circle","original_title":"Bledne Kolo","overview":"A creative documentary with elements of animation, based on the biography and work of the Polish painter, Jacek Malczewski.","poster_path":null,"media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[99],"popularity":1.1261,"release_date":"2005-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/zrx008cUtzHmNyPEo8hJpRGsfDB.jpg","id":1646671,"title":"The Amazing Adventures of Lost Socks 3: Socks in Space!","original_title":"Niesamowite przygody skarpetek 3. Ale kosmos!","overview":"Can a sock become a cunning sheriff, a brilliant sleuth or… an intergalactic traveller? Of course! In their new cinematic adventures, your favourite troublemakers from a drawer set out to explore new worlds.","poster_